  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 2 — WHY TRUST MATTERS
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" id="philosophy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-label rv">
        <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
        <span>The Foundation</span>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-grid">
        <div class="trust-left">
          <h2 class="rv">
            In Premium Business,<br>
            Aesthetics sparks interest.<br>
            <em>Trust closes the deal.</em>
          </h2>
          <p class="lead rv d1">
            Anyone can post a stunning visual post. But when a high-net-worth potential
            buyer/clients is committing thousands to hunderd of thousands of dollars, they are
            not buying aesthetics. They are buying certainty — legal clarity, market
            credibility, and the quiet confidence that your brand genuinely knows this
            landscape inside and out.
          </p>
          <p class="lead rv d2" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
            That is the gap I close. My background building digital authority for a legal
            services firm — from absolute zero — taught me how to transform dense regulatory
            knowledge into trust-driving content that converts serious audiences, not casual
            scrollers. I bring that exact discipline to premium businesses: where every
            post must do more than look beautiful. It must make a serious person trust you
            enough to pick up the phone.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="trust-cards rv d1">
          <div class="trust-card">
            <h4>The Problem With Vanity Metrics</h4>
            <p>
              Most content agencies chase reach and impressions. In premium businesses,
              irrelevant volume actively erodes credibility. One post that educates a
              verified lead is worth more than ten thousand empty likes. I build for the former.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-card">
            <h4>The Legal-to-Premium Transfer</h4>
            <p>
              I spent years distilling complex Indonesian government regulations into
              digestible, share-worthy content for a professional services audience.
              Translating legal frameworks, compliance obligations, and market data into
              compelling visuals is second nature to me — and premium businesses
              demands exactly this kind of rigorous, trust-first storytelling.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-card">
            <h4>Full-Stack Foundation. Scalable Leadership.</h4>
            <p>
              I am prepared to step into early-stage environments to architect your digital
              authority from the ground up. Brief me on the details on your business,
              the products, and the commercial objective. I handle the immediate heavy lifting—creative
              strategy, lead pipelines, and data analytics.—with zero hand-holding. Your
              team focuses on closing deals. Once the foundation is solid, my focus shifts
              to operational management: building and supervising a team to keep leads arriving
              pre-qualified and ready to act.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 3 — CASE STUDY
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" id="case-study">
    <div class="cs-glow"></div>
    <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:2">

      <div class="sec-label rv">
        <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
        <span>Featured Case Study</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-header">
        <div class="cs-title rv">
          <h2>
            From Zero Digital Presence<br>
            to <em>Qualified Authority.</em>
          </h2>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/rewang_rencang" class="cs-badge custom-hover-badge">
            <span>Rewang Rencang — Business Law Firm, Indonesia</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-meta rv d1">
          <p>
            A professional services firm navigating one of the most demanding digital
            environments: high-stakes subject matter, a trust-sensitive audience, complex
            regulatory content — and no existing digital presence whatsoever.
          </p>
          <p>
            Sound familiar to what premium business demands? Here is exactly what
            happened when we built the company digital authority strategy as we grow:
            attract the right people, not just any people.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-pillars">
        <div class="cs-pillar rv">
          <div class="cs-step">01 — The Challenge</div>
          <h3>A High-Stakes Brand With No Digital Voice</h3>
          <p>
            Rewang Rencang provided critical legal counsel to Indonesian
            businesses, navigating everything from initial corporate setup
            and intellectual property registration to complex ongoing government
            compliance and regulatory frameworks. Their expertise was exceptional
            — but their digital presence was nonexistent, and their business was
            operating at a loss.
          </p>
          <p>
              The challenge was not simply growth. It was credibility. Every post had to
              reinforce that this was a firm capable of handling serious legal 
              matters. Frivolous content was not an option. Neither was being ignored.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-pillar rv d1">
          <div class="cs-step">02 — The Strategy</div>
          <h3>Authority Over Volume. Verified Audiences Over Vanity.</h3>
          <p>
            I built an editorial strategy around demystifying Indonesian government
            regulations and business compliance — the precise pain points of the firm's
            ideal clientele. Each content piece served as a proof of expertise: carousels
            breaking down compliance laws, short-form explainers on corporate legal permits.
          </p>
          <p>
            I managed the full production pipeline — shoot direction, editor briefings,
            design execution in Canva and Affinity, copywriting in Indonesian,
            and continuous performance analysis to sharpen the algorithm's
            understanding of our target audience segment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-pillar rv d2">
          <div class="cs-step">03 — The Results</div>
          <h3>From Zero Followers to Stable Business Profitability</h3>
          <p>
            The account scaled from 0 to 5,000 highly targeted, professionally verified
            followers. These were not passive spectators: they were business owners, founders,
            and compliance officers — the exact high-intent clients the firm needed.
          </p>
          <p>
            The commercial outcome was unambiguous. The firm transitioned from a
            loss-making entity to stable profitability. Digital authority, built through
            strategic content, became the firm's one of the most effective business
            development channel.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

