        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillars">
        <!-- Pillar 1 -->
        <div class="pillar rv">
          <span class="pillar-num">01</span>
          <div class="pillar-title">Strategic &amp; Trust-Based Marketing</div>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            I architect content ecosystems built around credibility, not clout.
            In a market where a misplaced claim can cost a deal, every post is
            engineered to deepen trust with your highest-value audience — clients
            actively researching their next commitment.
