            <li class="pillar-li">Platform Algorithm Optimization</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 2 -->
        <div class="pillar rv d1">
          <span class="pillar-num">02</span>
          <div class="pillar-title">Production &amp; Creative Coordination</div>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            From shoot direction to final published post, I am capable to build 
            the entire creative pipeline. I brief photographers and videographers,
            coordinate editors, and maintain an uncompromising brand voice
            across every asset — ensuring your visual identity is as premium as
            your business portfolio.
          </p>
          <div class="pillar-sep"></div>
          <ul class="pillar-list">
            <li class="pillar-li">Photo &amp; Video Shoot Direction</li>
            <li class="pillar-li">Post-Production Management</li>
            <li class="pillar-li">Brand Voice &amp; Visual Identity Governance</li>
            <li class="pillar-li">Canva / Affinity / Adobe Suite Production</li>
            <li class="pillar-li">CapCut &amp; Short-Form Video Editing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 3 -->
        <div class="pillar rv d2">
          <span class="pillar-num">03</span>
          <div class="pillar-title">Tech, Data &amp; Performance Analytics</div>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            A Bachelor of Information Systems is not a standard credential for a content
            strategist — and that is precisely the competitive edge. I don't estimate
            algorithm behavior; I analyze it. Every creative decision is grounded in
            performance data, audience segmentation, and iterative optimization cycles.
          </p>
          <div class="pillar-sep"></div>
          <ul class="pillar-list">
            <li class="pillar-li">CS-Backed Algorithm &amp; Reach Analysis</li>
            <li class="pillar-li">Platform Insights &amp; Audience Segmentation</li>
            <li class="pillar-li">Content Performance Reporting</li>
            <li class="pillar-li">A/B Testing &amp; Iterative Optimization</li>
            <li class="pillar-li">Data-Driven Content Calendar Planning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

